const DEFAULT_MARKDOWN = `# 🚀 Your Project Name

> A compelling one-liner about what this project does.

## Overview

AI-generated README will appear here after you describe your project and click **Generate**.

## Features

- ✨ Feature one
- ⚡ Feature two
